    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. i'm a bit worried about \"bad faith\" actors though—like, people who might try to hide extra fees in the fine print or intentionally disrupt delivery to squeeze us for more money. what kind of specific protections or audit rights should i add to catch those kinds of hidden threats or bad actors before they cause real damage?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
