    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds solid. can you expand a bit more on how we handle those \"hidden\" or \"sneaky\" risks? sometimes it feels like these suppliers have these little ways of undermining the agreement that aren't exactly breaches of contract, but they definitely feel like they're working against us behind the scenes. how do we build in protections for that kind of subtle, untrustworthy behavior?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
